- \( V_{\text{mixed}} \) be the volume of the mixed solution = \( V_{\text{initial}} + V_{\textstandard}} \)

Mass balance equation:
\[
C_{\text{initial}} \times V_{\text{initial}} = C_{\text{standard}} \times V_{\text{standard}} + C_{\text{mixed}} \times V_{\text{mixed}}
\]

Since \( V_{\text{mixed}} = W_{\text{initial}} + V_{\text{standard}} \), the equation becomes:
\[
C_{\text{initial}} \times V_{\text{initial}} = C_{\text{standard}} \times V_{\text{standard}} + C_{\text{mixed}} \times (W_{\text{initial}} + V_{\text{standard}})
\]

