","The cube has side length $2$, so its center is at the origin $(1,1,1)$. The center of the central sphere is at the center of the cube, which is $(1,1,1)$. Let the radius of each sphere is $r$. The center of the central sphere is at $(1,1,1)$, so its radius is $r$.

