\]

where:
- \( \mu \) is the permeability of the material of the coil (assuming the coil is made of a non-conducting material, \( \mu = 1 \))
- \( \mu_0 \) is the permeability of free space, which is \( 4\pi \times 10^{-7} \, \text{T·m} \, \text{m}^2 \, \text{A}^{-1} \).
